---
/* Comment / blessings page (/comment/). Route shell combining:
   - <BlessingForm>: visitor-facing submission form, bound to Web3Forms.
   - <BlessingsWall>: the approved wall, loaded from data/blessings.env.
   Submissions are moderated BEFORE they appear (form -> email ->
   GitHub Issue approval -> data/blessings.env -> redeploy). */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import BlessingForm from '../components/BlessingForm.astro';
import BlessingsWall from '../components/BlessingsWall.astro';
---
<Base
  title="祝福我們"
  description="為翁強與 Josephine 留下一份祝福。"
>
  <a id="top"></a>
  <article class="page">
    <h1 class="page__title">祝福我們 ❤️</h1>
    <div class="content-text content-text--form">
      <p>給我們留下一句話、一段回憶、一份祝福 —— 都好。</p>
      <p>每一份心意，我們都會珍而重之，細心讀過之後，放上祝福牆與大家分享。</p>
    </div>

    <BlessingForm />

    <h2 class="page__subtitle">大家的祝福</h2>
    <BlessingsWall />
  </article>
</Base>
